    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "NEW YORK CITY\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailso\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\n2*1-2\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\nW*NAt\n#*#****\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef\nroasted on board and carved to order\nSeafood Platter\nCold Lush Seafood with a Tangy Japanese Sauce\n• X4#77\nBreast of Chicken Orienta\n**##\nTrout Grenobloise\nTrout Sauteed with Capers, Lemon, Butter and Fresh Parsley\nPlat du Jour",
      "Trout Grenobloise\nTrout Sauteed with Capers, Lemon, Butter and Fresh Parsley\n/ Vi: Z152\n**L.#**\nPlat du Jour\nSteamed Rice\n= 1 z\nButtered Vegetable Bouquet\nPotatoes Maison\nTossed Garden Salad\nCoffee\n3-E-\nSelection of Cheeses and Fruits\n******+\nDessert\nTY-F\nTea\nGreen Tea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nAL.\n*I*\n• * *\n**\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie Amaretto di Saronno Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\n236 KJC001",
      "NEW YORK CITY\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad.\nOne of the most remarkable real estate deals in history was negotiated in 1624 when Peter Minuit\nbought the island of Manhattan from the Indians for a reported $24 worth of trinkets.\nToday, a city of almost 8 million people, New York is perhaps the greatest port in the world and the\nfinancial, intellectual and artistic center of the United States of America. It is a city of superlatives,\nin a class by itself. Pan Am serves New York every day on its Round-the-World flights, and one\ncan reach New York on Pan Am from virtually anywhere in the world.\nOPAN AM.\n2007.054. 017"
    ],
